n></div><div style="margin-bottom:9pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline">Acquisitions</span></div><div style="margin-bottom:9pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">In March 2025, the Company purchased the fee simple interest in the land associated with the ground lease at Hyatt Regency Santa Clara in Santa Clara, California for a purchase price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-139" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:AssetAcquisitionConsiderationTransferred" scale="6" id="f-565">25.4</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million including transactions costs.</span></div></ix:continuation><div style="height:45pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div style="margin-bottom:9pt;margin-top:9pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">12</span></div></div></div><hr style="page-break-after:always"/><div style="min-height:72pt;width:100%"><div style="margin-bottom:9pt;margin-top:9pt"><span><br/></span></div></div><ix:continuation id="f-564-2"><div style="margin-bottom:9pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline">Dispositions</span></div><div style="margin-bottom:9pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">In February 2025, the Company entered into an agreement to sell the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="room" contextRef="c-140" decimals="INF" name="us-gaap:NumberOfUnitsInRealEstateProperty" scale="0" id="f-566">545</ix:nonFraction>-room Fairmont Dallas, in Dallas, Texas for a sale price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-140" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationC